<title>GERMANY: Hochtief says H1 building output up 6.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Hochtief says H1 building output up 6.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30:</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group building output		 5,880   vs up 6.9 pct</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		 5,920   vs down 30.2 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German building group is Hochtief AG. The company also said it expected satisfactory results for all of 1997.</p>
<p>--Bonn Newsroom + 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
